		<RichText x="1474" y="250" width="499" height="154" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">上限<span color="#ffdfbf">600</span><span>点，每次「小酌」与 「酣饮」至多</span><span color="#ffdfbf">+49%</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">+96%</span><span>；若受</span><span color="#bfccff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响，豪意值积累效率变为</span><span color="#ffbfbf">75%</span><span>，则「小酌」与「酣饮」分别</span><span color="#ffdfbf">+42%</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">+72%</span><span>。<br/>当退出「奋勇」状态时，增量积累效率将额外降低至原来的</span><span color="#ffbfbf">30%</span><span>，与其他乘算。<br/></span><span color="#bfffbf">(N4)</span><span> 退出「奋勇」状态时，积累效率不再额外降低。<br/></span><span color="#ffbfbf">(N5) </span><span>「小酌」与 「酣饮」至多</span><span color="#ffdfbf">+31.5%</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">+100%</span><span>；「酣饮」增量受星烁反应影响的积累效率变为</span><span color="#ffbfbf">90%</span><span>，「小酌」增量不受星烁影响。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1474" y="794" width="497" height="116" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">锚定者受到足够多的<span color="#ffacff">雷元素伤害</span><span>时会麻痹，突然中断技能。麻痹值上限</span><span color="#ffdfbf">90</span><span>点，当锚定者受到</span><span color="#ffdfbf">无附着雷</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">n单位雷</span><span>/</span><span color="#dfbfff">星超导雷伤</span><span>害时，麻痹值增加</span><span color="#ffdfbf">0.8</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">2n</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">10</span><span>点，若处于「奋勇」状态则麻痹值上限</span><span color="#ffccbf">减半</span><span>。<br/></span><span color="#ffbfbf">(N5) </span><span>处于/不处于「奋勇」状态的上限变为</span><span color="#ffdfbf">375</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">750</span><span>点，受到</span><span color="#ffdfbf">无附着雷</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">n单位雷</span><span>/</span><span color="#dfbfff">星超导雷伤</span><span>害时，麻痹值增加</span><span color="#ffdfbf">8</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">20n</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">80</span><span>点(奋勇)或</span><span color="#ffdfbf">1</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">2.5n</span><span>/<br/></span><span color="#ffdfbf">10</span><span>点(非奋勇)。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1474" y="474" width="500" height="135" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">豪意值满时进入「奋勇」状态，期间豪意值将不断下降，每秒<span color="#ffdfbf">-7.5</span><span>，持续约</span><span color="#ffdfbf">80s</span><span>。「奋勇」状态下受到</span><span color="#ffdfbf">无附着雷</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">n单位雷</span><span>/</span><span color="#dfbfff">星超导雷伤</span><span>时</span><span color="#ffdfbf">-4</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">-10n</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">-50</span><span>点豪意值。<br/></span><span color="#bfffbf">(N4)</span><span> 「奋勇」状态下攻击力提升</span><span color="#ffdfbf">25%</span><span>。<br/></span><span color="#ffbfbf">(N5) </span><span>豪意值改为每秒</span><span color="#ffdfbf">-15</span><span>，持续约</span><span color="#ffdfbf">40s</span><span>。期间将展开「水漫屏障」；「奋勇」状态下攻击力提升变为</span><span color="#ffdfbf">30%</span><span>。「奋勇」状态下受到</span><span color="#ffdfbf">无附着雷</span><span>/<br/></span><span color="#ffdfbf">n单位雷</span><span>/</span><span color="#dfbfff">星超导雷伤</span><span>时改为</span><span color="#ffdfbf">-4.8</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">-12n</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">-48</span><span>点豪意值。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
